            "created_at": "2026-10-19T02:44:27.257Z",
            "cooked": "<p>I’m looking for an opportunity as an n8n Developer / AI Automation Engineer.</p>\n<p>What’s actually built, not “worked on”:</p>\n<p>→ 36 workflows, 3 production systems, not tutorial projects, systems that run</p>\n<p>→ Multi-agent AI stacks wired into real databases, not a spreadsheet pretending to be a backend</p>\n<p>→ APIs, webhooks, end-to-end business logic. The unglamorous plumbing that decides whether a company’s ops actually work or just look like they do</p>\n<p>Every system is documented down to the architecture, not a screenshot dump, an actual paper trail of decisions.</p>\n<p>Portfolio: <a href=\"https://bykeyur.vercel.app/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://bykeyur.vercel.app</a></p>\n<p>Go roast it if you want. Genuinely open to reviews of the systems I’ve built, if something’s weak, I’d rather hear it from you than find out in an interview.</p>\n<p>Open to remote India or international, if the role’s legit.</p>\n<p>Hiring, or know someone who is? Say something. Silence doesn’t close deals.</p>",
